\[
  f(x_0)=-\frac{11}{8},\qquad f'(x_0)=3x_0^2-3=-\frac94.
\]
输入改变$h$时，一阶近似给出
\begin{equation}
  T_1(h)=f(x_0)+f'(x_0)h=-\frac{11}{8}-\frac94h.
\label{eq:analysis-cubic-linear-model}
\end{equation}
取$h=0.1$，$T_1(h)=-1.600$，而实际$f(0.6)=-1.584$。

